# =============================================================================
# ASCENDRA Admin Console — Environment Configuration Template
# Phase 19 Preparation
# STRICT SECURITY NOTICE: Frontend environment variables are public.
# NEVER put server secrets, database URLs, Redis keys, or private keys here.
